Hanumān consoles fallen star-like Tārā --- Hanumān teaches karma fruit and bubble body --- Hanumān urges guarding Aṅgada and future duties --- Hanumān urges cremating Vālin and crowning Aṅgada --- Tārā prefers embracing dead Vālin to hundred sons --- Tārā cedes duties to Sugrīva as father kin --- Tārā chooses sharing hero death bed
